    "10": {
      "note": "On task-structure or drift invalidation, ProjectionInputState._refresh_drift passes its retained contracts and an actionable-drift observation to pruning before reading analytical snapshots. Pruning deletes valid branch-orphaned snapshots only with complete native branch/contract/snapshot proof; failure of that proof retains snapshots. A deleted checkout/worktree alone does not prove its branch is gone, and a valid changed occurrence remains visible even when a sibling read is incomplete.",
